==History==
2016
*The Lava Hound [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 3/5/2016, in the [[Version History#May 2016 Update (3/5/2016)|May 2016 Update]].
*On 18/5/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (18/5/2016)|Balance Update]], increased the Lava Hound's hitpoints by 3% and Lava Pup's hitpoints by 9%.
*On 21/6/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (21/6/2016)|Balance Update]], increased the Lava Hound's damage by 28%.
*On 30/11/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (30/11/2016)|Balance Update]], decreased the Lava Pup's hitpoints by 1%. This was to fix a rounding error where a level 12 [[Princess Towers|Crown Tower]] should've been able to kill equivalent level Lava Pups in two shots.
2017
*On 12/6/2017, the [[Version History#June 2017 Update (12/6/2017)|June 2017 Update]], increased the Lava Hound's collision radius to 0.75 tiles (from 0.5 tiles). This change was not mentioned in any change notes.
2018
*On 24/1/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (24/1/2018)|Balance Update]], increased the Lava Hounds hitpoints by 5%.
*On 5/9/2018, the [[Version History#September%202018%20Update%20(5/9/2018)|September 2018 Update]], changed it so that {{Rarity|Legendary}} cards start at Level 9 and end at Level 13 (from 1 to 5).
2019
*On 26/11/2019, the [[Version History#End%20of%20November%202019%20Update%20(26/11/2019)|End of November 2019 Update]], added a card render to the Lava Hound's card info screen.
2020
*On 7/1/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (7/1/2020)|Balance Update]], increased the Lava Hound's range to 3.5 tiles (from 2 tiles). The damage of the Lava Pups was also increased by 70%, but their attack time interval was increased to 1.7 seconds (from 1 second), their first attack time interval was increased to 1 second (from 0.8 seconds), and their range was decreased to 1.6 tiles (from 2 tiles), now classified as Melee: Long. There was also an unannounced change to Lava Hound's pathing, allowing it to bypass some [[:Category:Building Cards|building]] placements it was not able to bypass before.
2021
*On 7/6/2021, the [[Version History#Summer%202021%20Update%20(7/6/2021)|Summer 2021 Update]], moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Lava Hound from P.E.K.K.A's Playhouse to Hog Mountain.
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
2022
*On 26/10/2022, the [[Version History#2022%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(26/10/2022)|2022 Quarter 3 Update]], moved the Arena to unlock the Lava Hound from Hog Mountain to Rascal's Hideout.
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
*On 3/10/2023, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(3/10/2023)|Balance Update]], decreased the Lava Hound's hitpoints by 6%.
2025
*On 4/2/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/2/2025)|Balance Update]], decreased the Lava Pups' damage by 7%.
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], decreased the Lava Hound's damage by 1.85%. It also increased the Lava Pups' hitpoints by 0.46%, and decreased their damage by 3.57%. The same update also fixed a bug where Lava Pups would not spawn after being buffed by [[Royal Chef]].

